#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:5
#: 04e9ee45ab7e4be984d331bca5780832
msgid "SiK Telemetry Radio"
msgstr "SiK数传电台"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:7
#: 60f5cd92043540519223c197a95f884e
msgid ""
"A *SiK Telemetry Radio* is one of the easiest ways to setup a telemetry "
"connection between your Autopilot and a ground station. This article "
"provides a basic user guide for how to connect and configure your radio."
msgstr "*SiK数传电台* 是在飞控和地面站之间建立数传连接的最简便方式之一。本文提供了如何连接和配置电台的基本用户指南。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:14
#: e4a05030cbab4bfb8be0d79dba7e9b8c
msgid "3DR Radio v2 (a consumer implementation of SiKRadio)"
msgstr "3DR Radio v2（SiKRadio的消费级实现）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:18
#: a56bb4da9c0c4d078dd7fb4342dccd3e
msgid ""
"This page was previously named *3DR Radio (version 2)* for 3DRobotics' "
"trusted high quality implementation of SiK radio. As this radio is no longer"
" available from 3DR, the page has been renamed to reflect the underlying "
"open source radio platform."
msgstr ""
"本页面此前命名为 *3DR "
"Radio（版本2）*，是3DRobotics对SiK无线电的可靠高质量实现。由于该电台不再由3DR供货，本页面已重命名以反映底层开源无线电平台。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:24
#: b4202545c6b8406baea203749734da06
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:26
#: 10115d0c69a94181816d128d7fcf2220
msgid ""
"A `SiK Telemetry Radio <https://github.com/ArduPilot/SiK>`__ is a small, "
"light and inexpensive open source radio platform that typically allows "
"ranges of better than 300m \"out of the box\" (the range can be extended to "
"several kilometres with the use of a patch antenna on the ground). The radio"
" uses `open source firmware <https://github.com/ArduPilot/SiK>`__ which has "
"been specially designed to work well with MAVLink packets and to be "
"integrated with the Mission Planner, Copter, Rover and Plane."
msgstr ""
"`SiK数传电台 <https://github.com/ArduPilot/SiK>`__ "
"是一款小巧、轻便、低成本的开源无线电平台，通常「开箱即用」即可达到300米以上的通信距离（通过在地面使用定向天线可将距离扩展至数公里）。该电台使用专为与MAVLink数据包良好配合并与Mission"
" Planner、Copter、Rover和Plane集成而设计的 `开源固件 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/SiK>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:34
#: e51066afac0f41b29ed48fbbfbd24379
msgid ""
"The radios can be either 915Mhz or 433Mhz and you should purchase the model "
"which is :ref:`appropriate for your country/region <common-telemetry-radio-"
"regional-regulations>`."
msgstr ""
"电台可选915Mhz或433Mhz频段，应购买 :ref:`适合您所在国家/地区 <common-telemetry-radio-regional-"
"regulations>` 的型号。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:37
#: df55bc881e5f4c33a768578b81a5d995
msgid ""
"As the platform is open source, implementation can be purchased from many "
"different sources, including ArduPilot Partners:"
msgstr "由于该平台是开源的，实现版本可从多个渠道购买，包括ArduPilot合作伙伴："

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:40
#: 96373364c8c042e1aa4f99ea46b3c4c3
msgid ""
"Search EBay for `SiK Telemetry Radio "
"<https://www.ebay.com/sch/i.html?_from=R40&_trksid=m570.l1313&_nkw=SiK+telemetry+radio&_sacat=0&LH_TitleDesc=0&_osacat=0&_odkw=3dr+telemetry+radio>`__"
" (be aware, many \"clones\" have incorrect analog modules and will "
"interoperate fine with themselves, although with reduced range, but not with"
" the original \"3DR\" design. OEM versions below do not have this issue)"
msgstr ""
"在EBay上搜索 `SiK数传电台 "
"<https://www.ebay.com/sch/i.html?_from=R40&_trksid=m570.l1313&_nkw=SiK+telemetry+radio&_sacat=0&LH_TitleDesc=0&_osacat=0&_odkw=3dr+telemetry+radio>`__"
" （请注意，许多「克隆」版本使用了不正确的模拟模块，与自身可以互通（尽管距离有所下降），但无法与原始「3DR」设计互通。以下OEM版本没有此问题）"

