#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:47
#: 41c5ccd9d0e6438f895f42fcbdbd0a16
msgid ""
"If you're looking for an alternative, the :ref:`RFD900 Radio Modem <common-"
"rfd900>` is highly recommended by many community members (The SiK platform "
"was based on the RFD900 and both platforms have continued to evolve). It "
"provides a significantly better range."
msgstr ""
"如果您正在寻找替代品，:ref:`RFD900无线电调制解调器 <common-rfd900>` "
"受到社区成员的高度推荐（SiK平台基于RFD900，两个平台都在持续发展）。它提供更大的通信距离。"

