#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:93
#: c1fc248afc5640d69f1bdcbcf3f64b68
msgid "Connecting the radios"
msgstr "连接电台"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:95
#: 73d07413027d463cbd6dd829dffc400a
msgid ""
"The radio has interchangeable air and ground modules, meaning that you use "
"them as a pair but it does not matter which one goes on the vehicle and "
"which remains on the ground."
msgstr "电台的空中模块和地面模块可互换，即成对使用但不区分哪一个安装在飞行器上、哪一个留在地面。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:99
#: 17877097e1824186936604b890cf3698
msgid ""
"The radio has a micro-USB port, and a DF13 six-position port. The following "
"sections explain how to connect these to autopilots and ground stations."
msgstr "电台有一个Micro-USB端口和一个DF13六针端口。以下章节说明如何将这些接口连接到飞控和地面站。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:110
#: 07c222b25efc4a398b6357970d5deb0d
msgid "Connecting to Pixhawk"
msgstr "连接到Pixhawk"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:112
#: 2cc0bcada864446383c229b62bf5b4c8
msgid ""
"Use the 6 pin DF13 connector that should have come with the radio to connect"
" the radio to your Pixhawk's \"Telem 1\" (\"Telem 2\" or \"Serial 4/5\" can "
"also be used but the default recommendation is \"Telem1\")."
msgstr ""
"使用随电台附带的6针DF13连接器，将电台连接到Pixhawk的「Telem 1」端口（也可使用「Telem 2」或「Serial "
"4/5」，但默认推荐「Telem1」）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:120
#: 887cbb0ddf1e4118b66a8cbd5f8e2aa3
msgid "Connecting to a PC"
msgstr "连接到PC"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:122
#: 1abdee52dda4476eb3a8441672bdd09f
msgid ""
"Connecting the radio to your Windows PC is as simple as connecting the micro"
" USB cable (which should have been included with the radio) to your PC. The "
"necessary drivers should be installed automatically and the radio will "
"appear as a new \"USB Serial Port\" in the Windows Device Manager under "
"Ports (COM & LPT). The Mission Planner's COM Port selection drop-down should"
" also contain the same new COM port."
msgstr ""
"将电台连接到Windows PC非常简单，只需使用Micro "
"USB数据线（应随电台附带）连接到PC即可。必要的驱动程序应自动安装，电台将在Windows设备管理器的端口（COM和LPT）下显示为新的「USB "
"Serial Port」。Mission Planner的COM端口选择下拉列表也应包含相同的新COM端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:132
#: d4ae1b18da2d4016a1c6aad51d0a91ee
msgid "To connect the radios:"
msgstr "连接电台："

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:134
#: e355221d13784ed592672b4e6f5e04f0
msgid ""
"Select the new COM port, set the baud rate drop down (which appears between "
"the COM port and Connect buttons) to 57600."
msgstr "选择新的COM端口，将波特率下拉框（出现在COM端口和Connect按钮之间）设置为57600。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:136
#: 65702d95866248019ce37b9b955a168e
msgid ""
"Press the **Connect** button and if the two radios connect successfully you "
"should be able to lean your vehicle left and right and see its attitude "
"update on the MP's Flight Data screen's artificial horizon."
msgstr ""
"按 **Connect** （连接）按钮，如果两台电台成功连接，您应该能够左右倾斜飞行器，并看到Mission "
"Planner飞行数据界面人工地平仪的相应更新。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:142
#: 08da417f883f43c99392d613aedb91a9
msgid "Connecting to an Android tablet"
msgstr "连接到Android平板"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:144
#: 8e9401877559433cab722d56db4e7422
msgid ""
"Connecting the radio to an Android tablet using the L shaped micro USB cable"
" (which should have been included with the radio). Then follow the "
"directions in your :ref:`preferred Ground Station app <common-choosing-a-"
"ground-station>`."
msgstr ""
"使用L形Micro USB数据线（应随电台附带）将电台连接到Android平板。然后按照您 :ref:`首选地面站应用 <common-"
"choosing-a-ground-station>` 中的说明操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:155
#: 2cf70b1f54fd424f92aa43e8abb21f11
msgid "Configuring using the Mission Planner"
msgstr "使用Mission Planner配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:157
#: d2e04397bd584cdb809a4ff007e7ad6d
msgid ""
"Many users will not need to configure their radios! One case where you might"
" do so is when you use your vehicle with others — in which case you will "
"need to specify different radio channels (Net ID)."
msgstr "许多用户无需配置其电台！需要配置的一种情况是与其他人一起使用飞行器时——在这种情况下，您需要指定不同的电台频道（Net ID）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:161
#: e51a006fca22499fba3e4981ef5a021c
msgid ""
"Mission Planner supports configuring your radios using a simple GUI "
"interface. For more information see :ref:`Configuring a Telemetry Radio "
"using Mission Planner <common-configuring-a-telemetry-radio-using-mission-"
"planner>`."
msgstr ""
"Mission Planner 支持通过简单的图形界面配置无线电。更多信息请参阅 :ref:`通过 Mission Planner 配置数传电台 "
"<common-configuring-a-telemetry-radio-using-mission-planner>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:165
#: 78c71e7447944eb5878761d79bedfba7
msgid "Updating the Firmware"
msgstr "更新固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:167
#: ef79073430fe45a7a86c204c9bfb8e1b
msgid ""
"You can check the firmware version (latest version is `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/SiK/stable/>`__ ) using the GUI tool "
"mentioned in the previous section and update if necessary with  :ref:`these "
"instructions<sik-firmware-update>`"
msgstr ""
"您可以使用上一节提到的图形界面工具检查固件版本（最新版本在 `此处 "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/SiK/stable/>`__），如有必要，按照 :ref:`这些说明<sik-"
"firmware-update>` 进行更新。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:170
#: b671b1482e2f4e45bca58856b1e05608
msgid "Expected range"
msgstr "预期通信距离"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:172
#: baa7e5327a034a428b7d8347f5328917
msgid ""
"Typical range achieved with the radios using standard configuration and "
"antenna is around 500m, but the range varies a lot depending on noise "
"sources and antenna setup."
msgstr "使用标准配置和天线时，电台的典型通信距离约为500米，但具体距离因噪声源和天线设置而有很大差异。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:177
#: 1b1b447a72f4459d9bdf0c0536a1a1d7
msgid "Diagnosing range issues"
msgstr "诊断距离问题"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:179
#: f73a69eda7c74b6a9fa6fbecc5675abe
msgid ""
"The first thing you should do when diagnosing range issues is the \"one "
"meter test\". Setup the two radios one meter apart and look at the local and"
" remote RSSI. You should get a value of over 190 for a standard SiK radio. "
"If you don't then your antennas may be faulty or your radios may have been "
"damaged. If you have ever run the radios without an antenna attached them "
"the radio may have been damaged."
msgstr ""
"诊断距离问题时，首先应进行「一米测试」。将两台电台相距一米放置，查看本地和远端RSSI。标准SiK电台应获得190以上的值。如果达不到，您的天线可能有故障，或电台可能已损坏。如果曾在未连接天线的情况下运行电台，电台可能已损坏。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:186
#: d42e97ddb5934a05bb6409ed6b9c7efc
msgid ""
"If that test passes then have a look at your local and remote RSSI and noise"
" from a flight. See the :ref:`advanced setup page <common-3dr-radio-"
"advanced-configuration-and-technical-information_diagnosing_range_problems>`"
" for detailed information on diagnosing range issues using telemetry logs."
msgstr ""
"如果该测试通过，则查看飞行中的本地和远端RSSI和噪声。有关使用数传日志诊断距离问题的详细信息，请参见 :ref:`高级设置页面 "
"<common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-"
"information_diagnosing_range_problems>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:192
#: 7012d03c82174e2da0080c3d7acf9eb3
msgid "Improving the range"
msgstr "提升通信距离"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:194
#: fed2379897704533ac265a75dd9e5572
msgid "The range can be improved by:"
msgstr "可通过以下方式提升通信距离："

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:196
#: 994cb3e472344a71bff47de88661c1ac
msgid ""
"Using an inexpensive 900Mhz yagi antenna on the ground like `these "
"<https://www.ebay.com/sch/i.html?_from=R40&_trksid=p2380057.m570.l1313.TR1.TRC0.A0.H0.X900mhz+yagi.TRS2&_nkw=900mhz+yagi&_sacat=0>`__"
"  perhaps mounted on an :ref:`Antenna Tracker <antennatracker:home>`"
msgstr ""
"在地面使用廉价的900Mhz八木天线（如 `这些 "
"<https://www.ebay.com/sch/i.html?_from=R40&_trksid=p2380057.m570.l1313.TR1.TRC0.A0.H0.X900mhz+yagi.TRS2&_nkw=900mhz+yagi&_sacat=0>`__），可安装在"
" :ref:`天线跟踪器 <antennatracker:home>` 上。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:197
#: 4ff17a238f174cb095b8216b0e9fc616
msgid ""
"Replace at least one of the two radios with a higher powered :ref:`RFD900 "
"<common-rfd900>`"
msgstr "将至少一台电台替换为功率更大的 :ref:`RFD900 <common-rfd900>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:199
#: 5380493ab1f9403caffc73e2d5e07b23
msgid ""
"Reduce the ``AirRate`` parameter which will increase range but at the "
"expense of the rate of the data transfer."
msgstr "降低 ``AirRate`` 参数，这将增大通信距离但会降低数据传输速率。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:202
#: 7c9e033f6a2046a6958f6200454702fa
msgid ""
"The graph below shows the ground and remote receiver strength vs distance "
"from home (in meters) for a test flight of a *3DR Radio* (SiK "
"implementation) on a SkyFun plane. The ground based radio was attached to a "
"3.5dB flat patch antenna. The SkyFun had a small 'wire' antenna. The graph "
"shows the vehicle reached a distance of nearly 3km and the link was "
"completely maintained throughout the flight."
msgstr ""
"下图显示了一次在SkyFun飞机上对 *3DR "
"Radio*（SiK实现）进行测试飞行时，地面和远端接收机信号强度与距Home点距离（米）的关系。地面电台连接了3.5dB平板天线，SkyFun使用小型「线材」天线。图表显示飞行器达到了近3km的距离，整个飞行过程中链路保持完好。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:212
#: 3e5aeadd8a95443aa3b2c518a2b1f172
msgid ""
"Although anecdotal, another user provided a Tlog showing a good link kept "
"while the vehicle was 4.5km from the base station, using default radio "
"settings for a 3DR 900 radio. The plane used a small omni antenna, and a 8dB"
" patch antenna on the ground station."
msgstr ""
"虽属个案，但另一位用户提供了一份Tlog，显示使用3DR "
"900电台默认无线电设置，当飞行器距基站4.5km时仍保持良好链路。飞机使用小型全向天线，地面站使用8dB平板天线。"

